\item[* task:] Filter `had' + the modals `can', `must' and `may'
\item[\ \ strategy:] This is a special, very ad hoc rule that takes care of the 
possibility to translate e.g. `he could have come' into `hij had kunnen komen'.
It presupposes a special Retro rule: Rretrospec.
